# Optional. Leave these unset to stay in demo mode, which is the default.
# Demo mode writes the report on your computer. It does not call an AI model
# and it does not need a key.
#
# To try a real model later, copy this file to .env.local and paste your own key.
# Never commit .env.local. Never put the key in the chat, the README, or the UI.
#
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
